                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuti ayumye myoyo yanu, itazoobi akaambo mukusalala kumeso aa-Leza Taateesu kuciindi ncati boole Mwami wesu Jesu antoomwe abasalali bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
